"%k\thour in the 24 hour clock, without leading zero (0 - 23)\n"
"%I\thour in the 12 hour clock, 2 digits (01 - 12)\n"
"%l\thour in the 12 hour clock, without leading zero (1 - 12)\n"
"%M\tminute, 2 digits (00 - 59)\n"
